OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome cloud through the morning
OL,6,Fand the odd shower, generally easing
OL,7,Fthroughout the morning. A largely dry
OL,8,Fafternoon with the return of some more
OL,9,Fshowers later with some bright spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping. Temperatures around
OL,11,Faverage with lighter winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMost showers easing through
OL,14,Fthe evening, becoming more confined to
OL,15,Fthe north of the region. Patchy cloud
OL,16,Ffor all, but a mild but comfortable
OL,17,Fnight for many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
