OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAny showers in the morning
OL,6,Fwill fade away, as cloud lifts and
OL,7,Fbreaks into the afternoon. Becoming
OL,8,Fdry, with sunny spells for all.
OL,9,FPleasantly warm for all.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA dry
OL,12,Fstart to the weekend, with sunny
OL,13,Fspells the odd shower by Sunday.
OL,14,FTurning warm on Saturday, but
OL,15,Ftemperatures will slowly decrease into
OL,16,Fnext week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
